  "title": "Avery Dennison® Promotes Bethany Nock To General Manager, Graphics Solutions North America",
  "summary": "Avery Dennison® today announced the promotion of Bethany Nock to General Manager, Graphics Solutions North America, effective January 26. She replaces Abby Monnot who has moved to a new position within Avery Dennison Materials Group North America, as Vice President of Marketing for the Labels and Packaging Materials division.",
